# Generated, lock and bulk files that ripgrep (and the Grep and Glob tools built on it)
# skips on a broad search. A census that must see everything uses `git grep` or
# `rg --no-ignore`. Read the large source files by range: .claude/rules/large-files.md.

# Generated from the API (make openapi)
web/lib/api/openapi.json
web/lib/api/schema.d.ts

# Bulk data
api/oracle/roadmap/unicode/confusables.txt

# Lockfiles
uv.lock
api/uv.lock
web/package-lock.json

# Design images and frames
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.pdf
